  "packWaste": 8,
  "theme": "touring3d",
  "mapLive": true,
  "_about": "Touring 3D cluster: the Touring composition with the same thin classic dials, now with a subtle chrome edge, inset face, embossed ticks, shadowed needles and a strong soft shadow around each dial, around a larger centre map whose sides tuck a little under the dials. The left dial is revs (0-8) with the gear, AUTO and a fuel bar; the right dial is speed on the car's speed scale; the middle window is the Waze map (or a light stand-in map when it is off), with a framed now-playing card that hangs a little over the map: record, title, artist, progress and times. Full screen: clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. Theme decorations and the DEMO tag come from the engine; no oil, coolant, torque or power readouts. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
